          code: "assert conflicting_files({'app.py': 'tax 1.08'}, {'app.py': 'tax 1.08', 'readme.md': 'docs'}) == [], 'expected: [] | actual: %r' % (conflicting_files({'app.py': 'tax 1.08'}, {'app.py': 'tax 1.08', 'readme.md': 'docs'}),)",
